Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.51,Pony,,0,0,0,,这只是为了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:46.34,Discord Upper,,0,0,0,,{\K100}{\K38}确{\K66}保{\K34}我{\K39}喝{\K32}水{\K34}足{\K23}够{\K32}量
